{"id":"ebcba3904cade675","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-weak-initial-algebra.md","title":"thm-polymorphic-weak-initial-algebra","display":"thm-polymorphic-weak-initial-algebra","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-weak-initial-algebra","aliases":["16-thm-weak-initial-algebra","16-thm--weak-initial-algebra"],"display":"thm-polymorphic-weak-initial-algebra","depends_on":["[[16-df-hagino-functor]]"],"source":"Theorem 8.2.2 pp.458–459 (PDF 478–479)","revision_date":"2026-10-20","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-weak-initial-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-weak-initial-algebra</span><span>16-thm--weak-initial-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-polymorphic-weak-initial-algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a61be48bb6776bfc\" href=\"?note=a61be48bb6776bfc\" title=\"16-df-hagino-functor\">16-df-hagino-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem 8.2.2 pp.458–459 (PDF 478–479)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a61be48bb6776bfc\" href=\"?note=a61be48bb6776bfc\" title=\"16-df-hagino-functor\">16-df-hagino-functor</a> 中带真正有限余积的 λ2、类型变量语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi\">\\(\\Xi\\)</span>、Hagino 类型树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(X)\">\\(P(X)\\)</span>、类型与项商范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_\\Xi\">\\(\\mathcal C_\\Xi\\)</span> 及函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=F_P\">\\(F=F_P\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi\">\\(\\Xi\\)</span> 新鲜的类型变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:F(A)\\to A\">\\(a:F(A)\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:A\\to F(A)\">\\(c:A\\to F(A)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_\\Xi\">\\(\\mathcal C_\\Xi\\)</span> 中任意箭头；选定闭项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat a:F(A)\\to A\">\\(\\widehat a:F(A)\\to A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat c:A\\to F(A)\">\\(\\widehat c:A\\to F(A)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=[\\widehat a]\">\\(a=[\\widehat a]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=[\\widehat c]\">\\(c=[\\widehat c]\\)</span>。所有函数与方程均是良型项转换类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\">\\(\\forall X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\">\\(\\exists X\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pack}\">\\(\\mathrm{pack}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{unpack}\">\\(\\mathrm{unpack}\\)</span> 的形成、β/η 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9691785e1689a2c1\" href=\"?note=9691785e1689a2c1\" title=\"16-df-lambda-systems\">16-df-lambda-systems</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|\\Xi|\">\\(n=|\\Xi|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat F_k(T)\">\\(\\widehat F_k(T)\\)</span> 是下节由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a61be48bb6776bfc\" href=\"?note=a61be48bb6776bfc\" title=\"16-df-hagino-functor\">16-df-hagino-functor</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}\">\\(\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}\\)</span> 定义的类型模式实例，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq n\">\\(k\\geq n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_k^+\">\\(T\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_k^+\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 始终仅指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_\\Xi\">\\(\\mathcal C_\\Xi\\)</span> 上的函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}\">\\(\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}\\)</span> 使用该页在长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的扩展类型语境中的开放良型项递归；in 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 及 out 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=n+1\">\\(k=n+1\\)</span> 的语境中，内部 pack 的类型绑定子则使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=n+2\">\\(k=n+2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mu F)^+\">\\((\\mu F)^+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\nu F)^+\">\\((\\nu F)^+\\)</span> 是下节显式弱化到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Xi,X\">\\(\\Xi,X\\)</span> 的类型树；map 的源靶上标使用这些树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu F,\\nu F,\\mathrm{in}_F,\\mathrm{out}_F,\\mathrm{fold}_a,\\mathrm{unfold}_c\">\\(\\mu F,\\nu F,\\mathrm{in}_F,\\mathrm{out}_F,\\mathrm{fold}_a,\\mathrm{unfold}_c\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakInitial}\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakInitial}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}\\)</span> 是此处展开的新谓词，对任意小范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> 及对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat F_k(T)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T),\\qquad\n\\widehat F_n(A)=F(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat F_k(T)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T),\\qquad\n\\widehat F_n(A)=F(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakInitial}_{\\mathcal A}(W)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow W\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A\\land(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A)\\ \\mathcal A(W,A)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}_{\\mathcal A}(W)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow W\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A\\land(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A)\\ \\mathcal A(A,W)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mu F&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall X.(\\widehat F_{n+1}(X)\\to X)\\to X,\\\\\n\\nu F&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists X.X\\times(X\\to\\widehat F_{n+1}(X)),\\\\\n(\\mu F)^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{1,0}(\\mu F),\\qquad\n(\\nu F)^+\\coloneqq\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{1,0}(\\nu F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{fold}_a&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda z:\\mu F.z[A]\\widehat a]:\\mu F\\to A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{in}_F&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda u:F(\\mu F).\\Lambda X.\\lambda a:\\widehat F_{n+1}(X)\\to X.\na(\\operatorname{map}_{P,n+1}^{(\\mu F)^+,X}(\\lambda z:(\\mu F)^+.z[X]a)u)]:F(\\mu F)\\to\\mu F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{unfold}_c&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda x:A.\\mathrm{pack}_{X.X\\times(X\\to\\widehat F_{n+1}(X))}(A,\\langle x,\\widehat c\\rangle)]:A\\to\\nu F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{out}_F&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda z:\\nu F.\\mathrm{unpack}(z;X,w.\n\\operatorname{map}_{P,n+1}^{X,(\\nu F)^+}(\\lambda x:X.\\mathrm{pack}_{Y.Y\\times(Y\\to\\widehat F_{n+2}(Y))}(X,\\langle x,\\pi_2w\\rangle))((\\pi_2w)(\\pi_1w)))]:\\nu F\\to F(\\nu F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{fold}_a\\circ\\mathrm{in}_F&amp;=a\\circ F(\\mathrm{fold}_a),\\\\\n\\mathrm{out}_F\\circ\\mathrm{unfold}_c&amp;=F(\\mathrm{unfold}_c)\\circ c,\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakInitial}_{\\operatorname{Alg}(F)}((\\mu F,\\mathrm{in}_F))&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}_{\\operatorname{Coalg}(F)}((\\nu F,\\mathrm{out}_F)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakInitial}_{\\mathcal A}(W)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow W\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A\\land(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A)\\ \\mathcal A(W,A)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}_{\\mathcal A}(W)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow W\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A\\land(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A)\\ \\mathcal A(A,W)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mu F&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall X.(\\widehat F_{n+1}(X)\\to X)\\to X,\\\\\n\\nu F&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists X.X\\times(X\\to\\widehat F_{n+1}(X)),\\\\\n(\\mu F)^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{1,0}(\\mu F),\\qquad\n(\\nu F)^+\\coloneqq\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{1,0}(\\nu F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{fold}_a&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda z:\\mu F.z[A]\\widehat a]:\\mu F\\to A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{in}_F&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda u:F(\\mu F).\\Lambda X.\\lambda a:\\widehat F_{n+1}(X)\\to X.\na(\\operatorname{map}_{P,n+1}^{(\\mu F)^+,X}(\\lambda z:(\\mu F)^+.z[X]a)u)]:F(\\mu F)\\to\\mu F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{unfold}_c&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda x:A.\\mathrm{pack}_{X.X\\times(X\\to\\widehat F_{n+1}(X))}(A,\\langle x,\\widehat c\\rangle)]:A\\to\\nu F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{out}_F&amp;\\coloneqq[\\lambda z:\\nu F.\\mathrm{unpack}(z;X,w.\n\\operatorname{map}_{P,n+1}^{X,(\\nu F)^+}(\\lambda x:X.\\mathrm{pack}_{Y.Y\\times(Y\\to\\widehat F_{n+2}(Y))}(X,\\langle x,\\pi_2w\\rangle))((\\pi_2w)(\\pi_1w)))]:\\nu F\\to F(\\nu F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{fold}_a\\circ\\mathrm{in}_F&amp;=a\\circ F(\\mathrm{fold}_a),\\\\\n\\mathrm{out}_F\\circ\\mathrm{unfold}_c&amp;=F(\\mathrm{unfold}_c)\\circ c,\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakInitial}_{\\operatorname{Alg}(F)}((\\mu F,\\mathrm{in}_F))&amp;\\land\n\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}_{\\operatorname{Coalg}(F)}((\\nu F,\\mathrm{out}_F)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源及证明：Theorem 8.2.2 pp.458–459（PDF478–479），已核对原书陈述、项的型属及两条计算。将 fold 的定义代入 in，依次使用项 β 和类型 β，即得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(F(\\mathrm{fold}_a)u)\">\\(a(F(\\mathrm{fold}_a)u)\\)</span>。将 unfold 代入 out，存在类型 β 后得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(\\mathrm{unfold}_c)(cx)\">\\(F(\\mathrm{unfold}_c)(cx)\\)</span>。代表元改变时，逐构造子同余保证 fold/unfold 的商类不变；in/out 中的绑定变量仍是原始项变量，不是商箭头。两个明确见证分别属于前页定义的代数与余代数 Hom 集，因此给出所断言的存在性。out 的 unpack 结果型为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(\\nu F)\">\\(F(\\nu F)\\)</span>，不含被消去的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，符合存在消去的新鲜条件。</p>\n<p>类型模式的语境参数现在显式显示：范畴函子 F 只作用于原语境中的对象，绑定类型变量处使用位置树实例化后的相应类型体；map 使用相同扩展语境。常量叶的弱化和类型弱化相容式都已在上游展开。</p>\n<p>本页替换先前未展开的 μ/ν 及弱泛性质，且把“任意可定义严格正端函子”的无据泛化收回原书的 Hagino 多项式范围。这是有具体来源的范围纠正，不额外声称介体唯一。额外参数化条件下的真正初始性／终结性仅是原书 p.460 的进一步讨论，不是本页结论。没有使用集合中“所有集合的积”解释 impredicative 量词。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-hagino-functor","status":"resolved","id":"a61be48bb6776bfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-hagino-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-hagino-functor","status":"resolved","id":"a61be48bb6776bfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-hagino-functor]] 中带真正有限余积的 λ2、类型变量语境 $\\Xi$、Hagino 类型树 $P(X)$、类型与项商范畴 $\\mathcal C_\\Xi$ 及函子 $F=F_P$。$X$ 为对 $\\Xi$ 新鲜的类型变量，$a:F(A)\\to A$、$c:A\\to F(A)$ 是 $\\mathcal C_\\Xi$ 中任意箭头；选定闭项 $\\widehat a:F(A)\\to A$、$\\widehat c:A\\to F(A)$，满足 $a=[\\widehat a]$、$c=[\\widehat c]$。所有函数与方程均是良型项转换类；$\\forall X$、$\\exists X$ 及 $\\mathrm{pack}$、$\\mathrm{unpack}$ 的形成、β/η 采用 [[16-df-lambda-systems]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-lambda-systems","status":"resolved","id":"9691785e1689a2c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-hagino-functor]] 中带真正有限余积的 λ2、类型变量语境 $\\Xi$、Hagino 类型树 $P(X)$、类型与项商范畴 $\\mathcal C_\\Xi$ 及函子 $F=F_P$。$X$ 为对 $\\Xi$ 新鲜的类型变量，$a:F(A)\\to A$、$c:A\\to F(A)$ 是 $\\mathcal C_\\Xi$ 中任意箭头；选定闭项 $\\widehat a:F(A)\\to A$、$\\widehat c:A\\to F(A)$，满足 $a=[\\widehat a]$、$c=[\\widehat c]$。所有函数与方程均是良型项转换类；$\\forall X$、$\\exists X$ 及 $\\mathrm{pack}$、$\\mathrm{unpack}$ 的形成、β/η 采用 [[16-df-lambda-systems]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-hagino-functor","status":"resolved","id":"a61be48bb6776bfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n=|\\Xi|$，$\\widehat F_k(T)$ 是下节由 [[16-df-hagino-functor]] 的 $\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}$ 定义的类型模式实例，$k\\geq n$、$T\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_k^+$。$F$ 始终仅指 $\\mathcal C_\\Xi$ 上的函子。$\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}$ 使用该页在长度 $k$ 的扩展类型语境中的开放良型项递归；in 的 $a$ 及 out 的 $w$ 均在 $k=n+1$ 的语境中，内部 pack 的类型绑定子则使用 $k=n+2$。$(\\mu F)^+$、$(\\nu F)^+$ 是下节显式弱化到 $\\Xi,X$ 的类型树；map 的源靶上标使用这些树。$\\mu F,\\nu F,\\mathrm{in}_F,\\mathrm{out}_F,\\mathrm{fold}_a,\\mathrm{unfold}_c$ 由下式定义；$\\mathrm{WeakInitial}$ 和 $\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}$ 是此处展开的新谓词，对任意小范畴 $\\mathcal A$ 及对象 $W$ 使用。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Xi","display":false},{"tex":"P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_\\Xi","display":false},{"tex":"F=F_P","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Xi","display":false},{"tex":"a:F(A)\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"c:A\\to F(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_\\Xi","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat a:F(A)\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat c:A\\to F(A)","display":false},{"tex":"a=[\\widehat a]","display":false},{"tex":"c=[\\widehat c]","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall X","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pack}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{unpack}","display":false},{"tex":"n=|\\Xi|","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat F_k(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_k^+","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_\\Xi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{map}_{P,k}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"k=n+1","display":false},{"tex":"k=n+2","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mu F)^+","display":false},{"tex":"(\\nu F)^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\Xi,X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu F,\\nu F,\\mathrm{in}_F,\\mathrm{out}_F,\\mathrm{fold}_a,\\mathrm{unfold}_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakInitial}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat F_k(T)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Inst}_{P,k}(T),\\qquad\n\\widehat F_n(A)=F(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WeakInitial}_{\\mathcal A}(W)&\\Longleftrightarrow W\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A\\land(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A)\\ \\mathcal A(W,A)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}_{\\mathcal A}(W)&\\Longleftrightarrow W\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A\\land(\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal A)\\ \\mathcal A(A,W)\\ne\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mu F&\\coloneqq\\forall X.(\\widehat F_{n+1}(X)\\to X)\\to X,\\\\\n\\nu F&\\coloneqq\\exists X.X\\times(X\\to\\widehat F_{n+1}(X)),\\\\\n(\\mu F)^+&\\coloneqq\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{1,0}(\\mu F),\\qquad\n(\\nu F)^+\\coloneqq\\mathsf W_{n,0}^{1,0}(\\nu F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{fold}_a&\\coloneqq[\\lambda z:\\mu F.z[A]\\widehat a]:\\mu F\\to A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{in}_F&\\coloneqq[\\lambda u:F(\\mu F).\\Lambda X.\\lambda a:\\widehat F_{n+1}(X)\\to X.\na(\\operatorname{map}_{P,n+1}^{(\\mu F)^+,X}(\\lambda z:(\\mu F)^+.z[X]a)u)]:F(\\mu F)\\to\\mu F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{unfold}_c&\\coloneqq[\\lambda x:A.\\mathrm{pack}_{X.X\\times(X\\to\\widehat F_{n+1}(X))}(A,\\langle x,\\widehat c\\rangle)]:A\\to\\nu F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{out}_F&\\coloneqq[\\lambda z:\\nu F.\\mathrm{unpack}(z;X,w.\n\\operatorname{map}_{P,n+1}^{X,(\\nu F)^+}(\\lambda x:X.\\mathrm{pack}_{Y.Y\\times(Y\\to\\widehat F_{n+2}(Y))}(X,\\langle x,\\pi_2w\\rangle))((\\pi_2w)(\\pi_1w)))]:\\nu F\\to F(\\nu F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{fold}_a\\circ\\mathrm{in}_F&=a\\circ F(\\mathrm{fold}_a),\\\\\n\\mathrm{out}_F\\circ\\mathrm{unfold}_c&=F(\\mathrm{unfold}_c)\\circ c,\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakInitial}_{\\operatorname{Alg}(F)}((\\mu F,\\mathrm{in}_F))&\\land\n\\mathrm{WeakTerminal}_{\\operatorname{Coalg}(F)}((\\nu F,\\mathrm{out}_F)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"a(F(\\mathrm{fold}_a)u)","display":false},{"tex":"F(\\mathrm{unfold}_c)(cx)","display":false},{"tex":"F(\\nu F)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":4790,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-stlc-syntax]]、[[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]、[[16-df-simple-type-semantics]]、[[16-thm-categorical-completeness]]、[[16-df-lambda-systems]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-signature]]、[[16-df-hagino-functor]]、[[16-thm-weak-initial-algebra]]、[[16-ex-church-weak-nno]]、[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]、[[16-df-lambda-fibrations]]。"}],"outgoing":["a61be48bb6776bfc","9691785e1689a2c1"]}